---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const steps = [
  ['01', 'Understand the idea', '/en/essays/idea-5min', 'Persistence is what passes through a constraint without losing structural identity.'],
  ['02', 'State the principle', '/en/premier-principe', 'GFT fixes the budget: total distinction = persistence + entropy.'],
  ['03', 'Read the cosmogony', '/en/big-bang', 'The primordial cascade explains the crystallisation of 2, the emergence of time, and μ* = 15 as an attractor.'],
  ['04', 'See one proof route', '/en/tableau-periodique', 'The periodic table gives a robust, visual, chemical first demonstration.'],
  ['05', 'Compare with measurements', '/en/resultats', 'Numerical results are grouped by domain, status, and validation level.'],
  ['06', 'Inspect the limits', '/en/limites', 'A credible theory must state what is proved, derived, validated, or still open.'],
];

const routes = [
  ['10 minutes', 'Catch the intuition', 'Read the idea in 5 minutes, then inspect the homepage logical chain.', '/en/essays/idea-5min'],
  ['30 minutes', 'Understand the mechanism', 'Read the fundamental principle, cosmogony, then the results dashboard.', '/en/premier-principe'],
  ['2 hours', 'Audit the case', 'Follow the T0–T6 chain, open statuses, then test the flagship scripts.', '/en/theorems'],
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Start here"
  description="Guided route for reading the Theory of Persistence in the right order."
>
  <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 md:py-14">
    <section class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.95fr] gap-8 items-stretch mb-12">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <p class="pt-tag pt-tag-bridge mb-5">Guided route</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-thmblue leading-tight mb-5">
          Start here
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The site has many entry points. This page gives the recommended
          reading order: first the principle, then the cosmogony that situates
          the cascade, then a readable demonstration, results, epistemic status,
          and limits.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          The goal is not to read everything at once, but to keep the thread:
          constraint, persistence, sieve, attractor, derivations, audit.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 text-white p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-xs font-sans uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-300 mb-5">
          Choose your pace
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          {routes.map(([time, title, text, href]) => (
            <a href={href} class="block rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/10 p-4 hover:bg-white/15 transition">
              <strong class="block text-amber-200 font-sans">{time} · {title}</strong>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate-300 leading-snug">{text}</span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-6">
        <p class="pt-tag pt-tag-thm mb-3">Main route</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-thmblue mb-3">
          The six-step reading path
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          This order separates intuition, principle, cosmological passage,
          accessible demonstration, numerical comparison, and limits.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3">
        {steps.map(([num, title, href, text]) => (
          <a href={href} class="pt-card block group">
            <span class="text-sm font-mono text-derorange">{num}</span>
            <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-thmblue text-lg mt-2 mb-2 group-hover:underline">{title}</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">{text}</p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] gap-8 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="pt-tag pt-tag-id mb-3">Through-line</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-thmblue mb-4">What to keep in mind</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          PT does not begin with a constant to tune. It begins with a
          conservation constraint: a system has a total budget of distinctions.
          That budget may appear as persistent structure or as entropic
          dispersion, but the balance is exact.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          The scientific question then becomes: does this conservation force
          recognizable structures? The first inspectable answer is the sieve;
          the first physical reading is cosmogony; the first robust showcase
          remains chemistry.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="font-sans font-semibold text-thmblue text-xl mb-3">Recommended 25-minute route</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
          <li><strong>5 min.</strong> Read “The idea in 5 minutes”.</li>
          <li><strong>5 min.</strong> Read “Fundamental principle” in Plain mode.</li>
          <li><strong>5 min.</strong> Read “Cosmogony” in Plain mode.</li>
          <li><strong>7 min.</strong> Read the periodic-table demonstration.</li>
          <li><strong>3 min.</strong> Open the results dashboard and limits page.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
